<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 4.2 points to 780.8 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 4.2 points to 780.8 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 4.2 points, or 0.54 percent, on Tuesday to 780.8, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eigth of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the trade index losing the most, down 4.5 points, or 1.80 percent, to 245 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
